DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The iicchhwwddtt driver supports the watchdog timer of the Intel 6300ESB I/O
     Controller Hub.

     iicchhwwddtt provides the standard watchdog(4) interface and may be used with
     watchdogd(8).  The watchdog timer can be configured via sysctl(8).

     Once the watchdog timer resets the CPU, the driver reports it on the next
     boot displaying the “reboot on timeout” message in the dmesg.

